  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n0.1 × 99% of 1000 + 1.5 ÷ 0.3 × 1.1\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n0.1 × 99% of 1000 + 1.5 ÷ 0.3 × 1.1\n\n= 0.1 × **(0.99 × 1000)** + 1.5 ÷ 0.3 × 1.1\n\n= 0.1 × 990 + **1.5 ÷ 0.3** × 1.1\n\n= **0.1 × 990** + **5 × 1.1**\n\n= 99 + 5.5\n\n= 104.5\n\n**∴ The value of 0.1 × 99% of 1000 + 1.5 ÷ 0.3 × 1.1 is 104.5**",
